{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.toffoli_transfer_matrix","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.toffoli_transfer_matrix","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:QOU.Shared.ArchimedeanEval"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.toffoli_transfer_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.toffoli_transfer_matrix","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L113-L131","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $P_{\\mathrm{flip}}(q; k_1, k_2)$ be the target-flip\namplitude on a $3$-strand nuclear braid with control types\n$(k_1, k_2) \\in \\{0,1\\}^2$ and target strand $3$, constructed\nfrom the Hecke crossing coefficients\n([transfer matrix product](#prop:skein-polynomial-transfer-matrix)).\nThen:*\n\n1.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:toffoli-transfer-matrix","label":"prop:toffoli-transfer-matrix","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/toffoli-transfer-matrix.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_vi_diagonal_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_vi_diagonal_formula","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L111-L111","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (vi) — Toffoli diagonal closed form:\n`P_{7,7}(q) = (q + √q − 1) / (q + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.P_7_7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.P_7_7","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L108-L108","doc":"The Toffoli-diagonal amplitude `P_{7,7}(q) = (q + q^{1/2} − 1) /\n(q + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_v_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_v_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L105-L105","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (v) — Classical limit: every target-flip\namplitude vanishes at `q = 1` because the core carries `(q − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_ii_generator_crossing_traced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.claim_ii_generator_crossing_traced","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L79-L79","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (ii) — σ₁ control-crossing transfer:\n`V̂₁(k) = z·c(k) + d(k)`, which is **type-dependent** (NOT `= z`;\nthe `d` offset distinguishes the control types). A target-flip\nfixes the control pair `k`, so the target-flip difference\n`Δ₁ = 0` — the control crossing is unchanged, not type-blind. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.d","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Affine offset `d_{k₁k₂}` of the σ₁ transfer: `0` for `𝔭𝔭`,\n`−(q − q⁻¹)/2` for mixed, `−(q − q⁻¹)` for `𝔫𝔫`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.V_hat_1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.V_hat_1","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L70-L70","doc":"Traced volume `V̂₁(k)` at generator `σ₁` for control type `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.z_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.z_real","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Markov parameter `z = 1/(q^{1/2} + q^{-1/2})` specialised to `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.c","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.c","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Crossing coefficient `c_{k₁ k₂}` of the control–control pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.P_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.P_flip","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Target-flip amplitude on a 3-strand nuclear braid, indexed by\nthe two control types `(k₁, k₂) ∈ {0,1}²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.toArchimedeanEval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext.toArchimedeanEval","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L41-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ToffoliTransferMatrixContext","kind":"class","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/toffoli_transfer_matrix.lean#L38-L112","doc":"Abstract context for the `toffoli_transfer_matrix` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}